[{"id":"ajaba-2-2-186-6","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odgovaram","en":"I answer"},{"bs":"odgovara","en":"he/it answers"},{"bs":"odgovoreno vam je","en":"you (all) were answered"},{"bs":"odgovorite!","en":"(you all) answer!"}],"ref":"2:186","answerWord":"أُجِيبُ","answerSound":"audio/a38c79bae83b6fca3ba4.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And when My servants question thee concerning Me, then surely I am nigh. I answer the prayer of the suppliant when he crieth unto Me. So let them hear My call and let them trust in Me, in order that they may be led aright.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["وَإِذَا","سَأَلَكَ","عِبَادِى","عَنِّى","فَإِنِّى","قَرِيبٌ","أُجِيبُ","دَعْوَةَ","ٱلدَّاعِ","إِذَا","دَعَانِ","فَلْيَسْتَجِيبُوا۟","لِى","وَلْيُؤْمِنُوا۟","بِى","لَعَلَّهُمْ","يَرْشُدُونَ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-5-109-6","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odgovoreno vam je","en":"you (all) were answered"},{"bs":"odgovorite!","en":"(you all) answer!"},{"bs":"odgovaramo","en":"we answer"},{"bs":"odgovoreno je","en":"she/it was answered"}],"ref":"5:109","answerWord":"أُجِبْتُمْ","answerSound":"audio/fdf3eccc6ece56646cdd.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"In the day when Allah gathereth together the messengers, and saith: What was your response (from mankind)? they say: We have no knowledge. Lo! Thou, only Thou art the Knower of Things Hidden,","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["يَوْمَ","يَجْمَعُ","ٱللَّهُ","ٱلرُّسُلَ","فَيَقُولُ","مَاذَآ","أُجِبْتُمْ","قَالُوا۟","لَا","عِلْمَ","لَنَآ","إِنَّكَ","أَنتَ","عَلَّٰمُ","ٱلْغُيُوبِ"],"marked":[6],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-10-89-2","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odgovoreno je","en":"she/it was answered"},{"bs":"odazvali ste se","en":"you answered"},{"bs":"odgovaramo","en":"we answer"},{"bs":"odgovara","en":"he/it answers"}],"ref":"10:89","answerWord":"أُجِيبَت","answerSound":"audio/a9ca41989a0261dca6be.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"He said: Your prayer is heard. Do ye twain keep to the straight path, and follow not the road of those who have no knowledge.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["قَالَ","قَدْ","أُجِيبَت","دَّعْوَتُكُمَا","فَٱسْتَقِيمَا","وَلَا","تَتَّبِعَآنِّ","سَبِيلَ","ٱلَّذِينَ","لَا","يَعْلَمُونَ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-14-44-13","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odgovaramo","en":"we answer"},{"bs":"odgovorite!","en":"(you all) answer!"},{"bs":"odgovaram","en":"I answer"},{"bs":"odgovoreno je","en":"she/it was answered"}],"ref":"14:44","answerWord":"نُّجِبْ","answerSound":"audio/85cba4a96658f207314e.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And warn mankind of a day when the doom will come upon them, and those who did wrong will say: Our Lord! Reprieve us for a little while. We will obey Thy call and will follow the messengers. (It will be answered): Did ye not swear before that there would be no end for you?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["وَأَنذِرِ","ٱلنَّاسَ","يَوْمَ","يَأْتِيهِمُ","ٱلْعَذَابُ","فَيَقُولُ","ٱلَّذِينَ","ظَلَمُوا۟","رَبَّنَآ","أَخِّرْنَآ","إِلَىٰٓ","أَجَلٍ","قَرِيبٍ","نُّجِبْ","دَعْوَتَكَ","وَنَتَّبِعِ","ٱلرُّسُلَ","أَوَلَمْ","تَكُونُوٓا۟","أَقْسَمْتُم","مِّن","قَبْلُ","مَا","لَكُم","مِّن","زَوَالٍ"],"marked":[13],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-27-62-1","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odgovara","en":"he/it answers"},{"bs":"odgovaramo","en":"we answer"},{"bs":"odgovoreno vam je","en":"you (all) were answered"},{"bs":"odgovorite!","en":"(you all) answer!"}],"ref":"27:62","answerWord":"يُجِيبُ","answerSound":"audio/8a72b2c9d926db19ff21.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"Is not He (best) Who answereth the wronged one when he crieth unto Him and removeth the evil, and hath made you viceroys of the earth? Is there any Allah beside Allah? Little do they reflect!","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["أَمَّن","يُجِيبُ","ٱلْمُضْطَرَّ","إِذَا","دَعَاهُ","وَيَكْشِفُ","ٱلسُّوٓءَ","وَيَجْعَلُكُمْ","خُلَفَآءَ","ٱلْأَرْضِ","أَءِلَٰهٌ","مَّعَ","ٱللَّهِ","قَلِيلًا","مَّا","تَذَكَّرُونَ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-28-65-4","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odazvali ste se","en":"you answered"},{"bs":"odgovoreno je","en":"she/it was answered"},{"bs":"odgovara","en":"he/it answers"},{"bs":"odgovaram","en":"I answer"}],"ref":"28:65","answerWord":"أَجَبْتُمُ","answerSound":"audio/c885775c6ee7d6229555.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And on the Day when He will call unto them and say: What answer gave ye to the messengers?","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["وَيَوْمَ","يُنَادِيهِمْ","فَيَقُولُ","مَاذَآ","أَجَبْتُمُ","ٱلْمُرْسَلِينَ"],"marked":[4],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-46-31-1","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odgovorite!","en":"(you all) answer!"},{"bs":"odgovara","en":"he/it answers"},{"bs":"odgovaramo","en":"we answer"},{"bs":"odgovaram","en":"I answer"}],"ref":"46:31","answerWord":"أَجِيبُوا۟","answerSound":"audio/4144be30a65f1fff31d7.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"O our people! respond to Allah's summoner and believe in Him. He will forgive you some of your sins and guard you from a painful doom.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["يَٰقَوْمَنَآ","أَجِيبُوا۟","دَاعِىَ","ٱللَّهِ","وَءَامِنُوا۟","بِهِۦ","يَغْفِرْ","لَكُم","مِّن","ذُنُوبِكُمْ","وَيُجِرْكُم","مِّنْ","عَذَابٍ","أَلِيمٍ"],"marked":[1],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}},{"id":"ajaba-2-46-32-2","words":["verb:ajaba-2"],"options":[{"bs":"odgovara","en":"he/it answers"},{"bs":"odazvali ste se","en":"you answered"},{"bs":"odgovaram","en":"I answer"},{"bs":"odgovorite!","en":"(you all) answer!"}],"ref":"46:32","answerWord":"يُجِبْ","answerSound":"audio/1c37e4318b20a77f77e2.m4a","quranTranslation":{"text":"And whoso respondeth not to Allah's summoner he can nowise escape in the earth, and he hath no protecting friends instead of Him. Such are in error manifest.","by":"M. M. Pickthall (1930), via tanzil.net"},"gloss":{"bs":"odgovoriti, odazvati se","en":"to answer, to respond"},"passage":["وَمَن","لَّا","يُجِبْ","دَاعِىَ","ٱللَّهِ","فَلَيْسَ","بِمُعْجِزٍ","فِى","ٱلْأَرْضِ","وَلَيْسَ","لَهُۥ","مِن","دُونِهِۦٓ","أَوْلِيَآءُ","أُو۟لَٰٓئِكَ","فِى","ضَلَٰلٍ","مُّبِينٍ"],"marked":[2],"facts":{"verb":"أَجَابَ"}}]